            '`flutter.ndkVersion` (and thus AGP at configuration time) '
            'resolves to. A second, hand-pinned version drifts the moment '
            'the Flutter pin moves',
      );
      expect(
        body,
        contains(ndkVersionDeclPattern),
        reason:
