        200,
        headers: {'content-type': 'text/event-stream'},
      ),
    );

final testModel = Model(
  id: 'gpt-4o-mini',
  name: 'GPT-4o mini',
  api: 'openai-completions',
  provider: 'openai',
  baseUrl: 'https://api.openai.com/v1',
  input: const ['text'],
  contextWindow: 128000,
  maxTokens: 16384,
  cost: const ModelCost(input: 0.15, output: 0.6, cacheRead: 0.075),
);

